      "claimOrdinal": 1,
      "claim": "It also improves locking performance for queries accessing many relations, enhances hash joins and `GROUP BY` performance and reduces their memory usage, allows normal vacuums to freeze all-visible pages to reduce later full-relation freezing overhead via the `vacuum_max_eager_freeze_failure_rate` setting, and adds the `vacuum_truncate` server variable to control file truncation during `VACUUM`.",
      "deterministicStatuses": {
        "technical": "PASS",
        "numeric": "PASS",
        "version": "PASS"
